4,3939,3939.T,カナミックＮ,7,ok,EQUITY,"Kanamic Network Co.,LTD",Healthcare,Health Information Services,https://www.kanamic.net,"Kanamic Network Co.,LTD operates as an application and communication service provider in the elderly care and medical care fields in Japan. It offers an elderly care system, including in-home elderly care support, home-visit services, outpatient day care, residential services, in-facility services, community-based services, welfare equipment, and disabilities support services; elderly care software; and a system for community support centers. The company also provides a childcare support system, which offers cloud service support for raising children, comprising information distribution, consultation, and child growth tracking functions, as well as a medical care system for in-home care. In addition, it provides systems integration and solutions, website creation and operational services, management and systems consulting services, paid job placement services, and education and training services. Further, the company is involved in the planning, production, and sale of web content, videos, and various sales promotion tools, as well as the planning and conducting of lectures, seminars, academic meetings, etc. Kanamic Network Co.,LTD was incorporated in 2000 and is headquartered in Shibuya, Japan.",23301531648,JPY,,home_unavailable,https://www.kanamic.net,
4,3940,3940.T,3940.T,5,ok,EQUITY,"Nomura System Corporation Co, Ltd.",Technology,Information Technology Services,https://www.nomura-system.co.jp,"Nomura System Corporation Co, Ltd. provides ERP solutions in Japan. The company offers SAP ERP consulting services, including business process reform plan development, IT investment plan development, and IT diagnostics; project preparation, business design, and additional development design; implementation and preparation for go-live; and going-out support, and operation and maintenance services. It also provides short-term implementation plan; SAP on HANA migration service; and SAP new UX service. In addition, the company offers robotic process automation, web development, and big data consulting services. Further, it provides Rcas-Win, a SAP ERP accounting solution; Zex-One, a SAP EMS fixed asset solution; GeeBBIT, a SAP ERP appendix 16 solutions; Jet-One, a SAP ERP human resources solutions; SAP SucessFactors, a talent management solutions; BeeBBit, a SAP ERP human resources/BI solution; XronoLink, a web based attendance management solution; Bl-Vivid, a SAP business analytics solution; and project resilience theory. Nomura System Corporation Co, Ltd. was incorporated in 1986 and is headquartered in Shibuya, Japan.",5906763264,JPY,,ok,https://www.nomura-system.co.jp | https://www.nomura-system.co.jp/business/ | https://www.nomura-system.co.jp/product/,"ノムラシステムコーポレーション | 戦略的ERP導入コンサルティングから導入後の保守・運用までをワンストップサポート 戦略的ERP導入コンサルティングから導入後の保守・運用までをワンストップサポート サイトマップ パートナー お問い合わせ 事業・サービス 製品 導入事例 DX ニュース 企業情報 IR情報 株主・投資家の皆様へ 採用情報 SHARED AMBITION, TRUE RESULTS 志の共有が真の成果を生む ノムラシステムコーポレーションは、クライアントのビジネスパートナーとして、戦略的システム導入コンサルティングを通じ、 情報利用に対する斬新且つ、実績に結びつく革命的なシステムを構築し、 継続した成果を導き出すために組織を動かします。 事業・サービス一覧はこちら コンサルティング事業部 ERPコンサルティングサービス SAP ERPコンサルティング 短期導入プラン 保守サービス 次世代コンサルティングサービス RPAコンサルティング Web系開発コンサルティング ビックデータコンサルティング SAP公認のチャネルパートナー ノムラシステムは、一定の審査をクリアしたパートナーのみが認定されるSAP社公認のオフィシャルパートナーです。 日本初！PCoE認定（保守センター）を取得 SAP社に代わり、お客様のSAPソリューションの一