4,4055,4055.T,Ｔ＆Ｓ・Ｇ,5,ok,EQUITY,T&S Group Inc.,Technology,Information Technology Services,https://www.tecsvc.co.jp,"T&S Group Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides system development and operation/maintenance services in Japan. It offers artificial intelligence (AI) software development solutions comprising software solutions for Hailo Edge AI processors, Generative AI-assisted software development support, AI algorithm research and development support, and AI software development services; system development solutions, including business and cloud applications, and medical and embedded systems development, as well as software acceleration solutions; and information technology (IT) infrastructure construction solutions, such as server and network design and construction services. The company also provides system maintenance and operation solutions comprising migration support, version up, and maintenance and operation services; software engineering services, including IT support, infrastructure maintenance, and operation services, as well as information security services; and system verification solutions, such as on-premises and cloud applications verification, embedded system verification, and performance testing and test automation tools. The company was formerly known as T&S inc. and changed its name to T&S Group Inc. in June 2024. T&S Group Inc. was founded in 1985 and is headquartered in Yokohama, Japan.",12526755840,JPY,,ok,https://www.tecsvc.co.jp | https://www.tecsvc.co.jp/company/ | https://www.tecsvc.co.jp/our-business/,"ティアンドエスグループ（システムコンサルティング・ソフトウェア開発・ネットワークインテグレーション） Home ホーム News ニュース News ニュース IR News IRニュース Company Info 企業情報 Message 代表挨拶 Corporate Philosophy 企業理念 Company Profile 会社概要 History 沿革 Board Members 役員紹介 Organization Chart 組織図 Access アクセス Our Business 事業内容 IR Information IR情報 To Our Shareholders and Investors 株主・投資家の皆さまへ IR News IRニュース Management Policy 経営方針 Financial Highlights 業績ハイライト IR Library IRライブラリー Research Report 外部会社(シェア