4,4097,4097.T,4097.T,2,ok,EQUITY,"Koatsu Gas Kogyo Co., Ltd.",Basic Materials,Specialty Chemicals,https://www.koatsugas.co.jp,"Koatsu Gas Kogyo Co., Ltd., together with its subsidiaries, engages in the gas and chemical products businesses in Japan. It provides dissolved acetylene gas for welding, cutting, heating, removing glass and copper wire from molds, pharmaceutical synthesis, and carbon raw materials applications; laser gas and mixed gas for various applications, such as laser processing, welding, sterilization, biotechnology, and food products; separated gas used analytical instruments for measuring the concentration of various air pollutants, automobile exhaust gas and flue gas, and calibration of gas detectors; LP gas/LNG for cutting/heating and fuel applications; agricultural carbon dioxide; gas cylinders; and safety systems. The company also offers chemical products, such as adhesives; PEGAR, a synthetic resin emulsion developed for various applications such as adhesives, pressure sensitive adhesives, paint binders, and additives for construction materials; CYANON, an adhesive made from a cyanoacrylate monomer, which used for electric and electronic components, timber products and construction materials; Pegalock, an acrylate monomer; and sound proof, a combination of special resin and a nonwoven shock-absorbing material. Further, it offers electronic papers application, a display that can be controlled wirelessly or by wire; RF tag related devices and their application systems, which used for railway equipment management and recognition of production lines; GNSS receiver modules; and LSI card and reader writers. Koatsu Gas Kogyo Co., Ltd. was incorporated in 1943 and is headquartered in Osaka, Japan.",66354442240,JPY,,ok,https://www.koatsugas.co.jp,"高圧ガス工業株式会社 TOP 文字の大きさ 中 大 言語 Jp En HOME 会社情報 会社情報 社長ご挨拶 会社概要・沿革 組織図 事業場一覧 関係会社一覧 事業紹介 事業紹介 ガス事業 化成品事業 ITソリューション事業 グローバル展開 製品情報 ガス 製品概要 産業・医療用ガス 溶接・混合ガス 特殊ガス 容器・器具・機材 農業用炭酸ガス 化成品 製品概要 ペガール シアノン ペガロック サウンドプルーフ 