upports CPA optimization. By improving the accuracy of effectiveness measurement, it is possible to improve the efficiency of advertising investment and enhance marketing measures. L-SCORE byGMO Swipe-type LP SaaS This is a service that allows you to create and operate swipe-style web pages optimized for smartphones without coding. Its intuitive operability enhances the user experience and helps improve conversion rates and browsing rates. SwipeKit by GMO Other Businesses Affiliate Advertising This is a service that provides performance-based advertising for smartphone apps and the web. It supports performance measurement, including engagement after app installation, and a variety of delivery formats, helping advertisers increase revenue and acquire users. GMO SmaAD GMO SmaAFFi Gift Link by GMO Out-of-app purchases This is a service that allows app developers to sell digital content through their websites. Not only can you reduce fees and increase your revenue, but you can also acquire app users by linking with our affiliate service. GMO Out-of-app billing Advertising This is a service that helps maximize advertising effectiveness through programmatic advertising for websites and smartphone apps. We provide consistent support from strategic design to operation and improvement. Management advertising (GMO TECH) Management advertising (GMO Tryhatch) Job Advertisement This is a service that supports everything from posting job advertisements to managing them and improving their effectiveness. By optimizing distribution to multiple media and operations, we maximize the number of applications and improve recruitment efficiency. Job search engine GMO Jobbi FeedDash! byGMO Job Search Dash! byGMO Real estate appraisal service This is a real estate sales-focused appraisal site that allows you to request appraisals from multiple real estate companies at once. We support real estate companies in attracting customers by securing appraisal requests. GMO Real Estate Appraisal Dev