4,4169,4169.T,エネチェンジ,10,ok,EQUITY,ENECHANGE Ltd.,Technology,Software - Application,https://www.enechange.co.jp,"ENECHANGE Ltd. engages in the energy platform business in Japan. It operates through three segments: Gee Data; EV Charging; and Energy Distribution Platform. The company operates ENECHANGE, an electricity and gas switching service for consumers and ENECHANGE Biz, a platform for switching electricity and gas services for businesses; and cloud-based DX services for electricity and gas utilities and EV services. It is also involved in the provision of EV charging services under the EV Charging Enechange brand name. The company was incorporated in 2015 and is headquartered in Chuo, Japan.",11458599936,JPY,,home_unavailable,https://www.enechange.co.jp,
4,416A,416A.T,416A.T,1,ok,EQUITY,"Fuji United Holdings Company,Ltd.",Energy,Oil & Gas Refining & Marketing,https://www.fujiunited.com/en,"Fuji United Holdings Company,Ltd. purchases and sells petroleum products in Japan. The company operates through the Oil Business, Recycling Business, Renewable Energy Business, Home Energy Business, and Rental Business segments. It offers biodiesel fuels, recycled heavy oil, carbon offset fuels, fuel oils, asphalts, and lubricants, as well as AdBlue, a urea water for ammonia-based exhaust gas purification systems. The company also collects, transports, and processes industrial waste, as well as manufactures and sells recycled heavy oil; sells electricity generated by solar power plants; sells household fuel in small lots; and rents construction machinery and other equipment. Fuji United Holdings Company,Ltd. was founded in 1949 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan.",8539787776,JPY,,ok,https://www.fujiunited.com/en,"FUJI UNITED HOLDINGS COMPANY, LTD. Management Strategy Management Strategy Front page Top Message Group Management Vision About Us Sustainability Company Information Company Information Front page Corporate Outline / List of Directors / Organizational Chart History Group Companies Japanese English Inquiries Who We Are We have taken a new step forward as a holding company. Our name is Fuji United Holdings. “Fuji” embodies the pride of the Fuji Kosan Group, our point of origin, while “United” expresses our desire to support and uplift one another. The name symbolizes the bonds of our group: harmony, collaboration, and cooperation. Our logo incorporates the initial “F” of the Fuji Kosan Group, a circle, symbolizing continuity, and a banner raised toward the future. Moving forward, we will face this era of change with sincerity. Guided by our commitment to “be open to changes for tomorrow,” we will follow closely alongside each individual’s tomorrow and advance together. Group Management Vision News Release No articles yet.