ompany Powered by machine learning, deep learning, generative AI, and proprietary algorithms, Appier’s vision is to make AI easy by making software intelligent, delivering world-class marketing solutions that drive measurable growth and empower our clients. Appier's Three AI Clouds Autonomous, Adaptive, and Agentic. Ad Cloud Personalization Cloud Data Cloud Ad Cloud Performance-driven advertising powered by the Ad Cloud. Maximize ROAS with AI that automates creative testing, audience targeting, and campaign optimization. Learn More Personalization Cloud Customer engagement at scale powered by the Personalization Cloud. Deliver meaningful, cross-channel experiences that convert. Personalize every touchpoint with AI that adapts in real time. Learn More Data Cloud Unified insights driven by the Data Cloud. Unlock audience intelligence and enable real-time decision-making across your marketing stack. Centralize, segment, and activate your data with precision. Learn More Ad Cloud Performance-driven advertising powered by the Ad Cloud. Maximize ROAS with AI that automates creative testing, audience targeting, and campaign optimization. Learn More Personalization Cloud Customer engagement at scale powered by the Personalization Cloud. Deliver meaningful, cross-channel experiences that convert. Personalize every touchpoint with AI that adapts in real time. Learn More Data Cloud Unified insights driven by the Data Cloud. Unlock audience intelligence and enable real-time decision-making across your marketing stack. Centralize, segment, and activate your data with precision. Learn More AI Success in Action How Industry Leaders Achieve Measurable Results Gaming E-Commerce Retail Finance & Insurance Automobile High-ROAS user acquisition from Day 1 Nexon deployed AIBID user acquisition and re-engagement solution to identify and target the most valuable gamers for its titles. From Day 1 of a game’s launch, AIBID has been able to successfully acquire high-ROAS users who will play the game long-term and make in-app purchases. Learn More UA for idle tower defense game GameDuo used Appier's Ad Cloud for in-app data, forming new user profiles and leveraging AI for targeting during the campaign, resulting in a remarkable 41% conversion boost. Learn More High-ROAS success in EMEA casual game Get Color's campaign for its hyper-casual game spanned 5 countries, focusing on high-value gamers with optimized content to achieve remarkable ROAS and CPI reduction. Learn More Virtual PC game user acquisition strategy The Sandbox employed Appier’s Ad Cloud in Hong Kong and Taiwan for Alpha Season 3, expanding their audience and increasing engagement, notably raising the season's CTR. Learn More Leading global beauty brand Clarins leveraged Appier’s Ad Cloud and AiDeal solutions to successfully reduce the CPA of its campaigns by 30% and improve the CVR by 44% during Q3 to Q4 2021 and boost sales season momentum. Learn More Top player in the children's fashion industry Explore how F・O・International partnered with Appier to revolutionize their marketing strategy, unify customer data, and usher in a new era of personalized customer engagement. Learn More Japanese Multinational Cosmetics Company Shiseido Taiwan Group introduced timely and exclusive coupons to communicate with hesitant buyers individually, allowing watashi+ by Shiseido Taiwan to successfully increase conversion rates by 47%. Learn More French Multinational Retail Group Carrefour used Appier's solutions to identify high-value customers and hesitant buyers through user behavior and purchase intent analysis—crafting tailored campaigns to target each group accordingly. Learn More One of the World’s Largest Pizza Chains Pizza Hut used AIDEAL to detect real-time intent and send coupons to hesitant customers. Those who received a coupon completed their orders faster, resulting in a 20% growth in order placement. Learn More The world’s second-largest fast-food chain Burger King adopted AIQUA to analyze and utilize customer behavior data. The brand was able to manage cross-channel campaigns on a single platform and implement marketing personalization strategy. Learn More Thailand's Premier Financial Institution KCC utilized AI predictions to expand user reach and deepen engagement by delivering content that customers were most interested in at the times when they were most likely to be receptive to it. Instead of overwhelming their customers with information, they gave them exactly what was needed. Learn More Longstanding Insurance Company in Taiwan MSIG Insurance used AIXON to fine tune its marketing to target high-value customers and differentiate communications for finely delineated customer segments. Learn More Leading Insurance Company in Taiwan Shin Kong Life leverages Appier for big data marketing, personalized journeys, and precise insurance services, achieving a triple-win of increased profits, agent sales targets, and user satisfaction. Learn More Premier Japanese Automotive Manufacturer Toyota Philippines approached Appier with a KPI of driving site traffic to 44,073 visits in a month. Using audience targeting, geo-targeting, topic targeting and cross-screen targeting, Appier increased traffic to the site by threefold, compared to overall site traffic prior to the campaign. Learn More World-Famous German Automobile Brand Audi applied Appier’s AI to identify all the devices owned by its target audiences for cross-screen targeting. It also used Frequency Capping to deliver more ad exposure to the devices most likely to be used by users to sign up for the test drive, while avoiding ad fatigue. Learn More World-Famous German Automobile Brand In 2022, with Appier’s BotBonnie, BMW Taiwan leveraged Meta’s Recurring Notifications feature to successfully ramped up social media engagement 4X on Facebook during a three-day campaign. Learn More Driving Innovation, Earning Trust Appier Named as Best Business AI Applications Service Provider 2021 by APAC Insider AiDeal Named as Best Overall AI-based Analytics Solution in 2020 by AI Breakthrough Appier Highly Commended in The Drum Digital Advertising Awards APAC 2020 Appier ranked as Tops ROI-Driving Ad Partner by Singular Appier Received TAG Anti-Fraud Certification Appier Received ISO 27001 Certification Appier Received ISO 27701 Certification Appier Named in CB Insights’ Second Annual AI 100 Companies 2018 Appier Named as Gartner Cool Vendor for Artificial Intelligence, East Asia, 2017 Ready to Turn AI into ROI? Let’s Talk. Take the first step to engage your customers with our AI solution. Contact Us Making AI easy by making software intelligent Products RETARGETING AIBID AdCreative.ai AIXPERT AIQUA BotBonnie AiDeal AIXON AIRIS Industries E-Commerce Retail Finance & Insurance Gaming Automobile Resources Case Studies White Papers & Guides Blog Webinar About About Us Careers Newsroom Investor Relations Trust Center ESG Contact Us Investor Relations Overview IR News Financial Calendars Structure Board of Directors Audit and Supervisor Committee © 2026 Appier Inc. All Rights Reserved. PRIVACY POLICY Do Not Sell/Share My Personal Information Limit the Use of My Sensitive Personal Information About Us｜Appier Why Appier Products Products One-stop AI solutions to grow your business along the customer journey, from acquisition, engagement to conversion and unlock new possibilities with prediction. Book a Demo Ad Cloud RETARGETING AIBID AIXPERT AdCreative.ai Personalization Cloud AIQUA AiDeal BotBonnie Data Cloud AIXON AIRIS Data Cloud Product Synergy AIQUA + AIRIS - Intelligent Data-Driven Engagement Appier AI Agent Appier AI Agent Solutions Use Cases Optimize User Acquisition Drive Engagement and Conversion Increase User Retention and Loyalty Industries E-Commerce Retail Finance & Insurance Gaming Automobile Resources and Events Case Studies White Papers & Guides Blog Webinar Event Resource Center About About Us Careers Newsroom Trust Center ESG Investor Relations Investor Relations The 