eives US$6 million Series A funding from Sequoia Capital December Branch office set up in Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam 2014 January Founded Appier in Taipei, Taiwan 2015 April Branch office set up in Sydney, Australia July Branch office set up in Manila, Philippines September Branch office set up in Mumbai, New Delhi, Jakarta and Hong Kong November Appier raises US$23 million in Series B1 funding from UOB Venture Management, Sequoia Capital, JAFCO Asia, TransLink Capital, MediaTek Ventures, Fontaine Capital and UMC Capital December Branch office set up in Korea (Seoul) and Malaysia (Kuala Lumpur) office 2016 December Appier raises US$19.5 million in Series B2 funding from Pavilion Capital International Pte Ltd, WI Harper Group, FirstFloor Capital and Qualgro 2017 May Branch office set up in Thailand July Appier launches AI-based Data Science Platform AIXON. Branch office set up in Osaka, Japan August Appier raises US$33 million in Series C funding from SoftBank Group, LINE Corporation, NAVER Corporation, EDBI and AMTD Group 2018 August Appier acquires India-based company QGraph and launches AI-driven Proactive Customer Engagement Platform AIQUA 2019 July Appier launches Aictivate to re-engage and retain mobile gamers October Appier acquires Japan-based company Emin. AiDeal, the augmented marketing and customer targeting solution joins Appier’s suite of AI marketing products November Appier raises US$80 million in Series D funding from TGVest Capital, HOPU-ARM Innovation Fund, Temasek’s Pavilion Capital, Insignia Venture Partners, JAFCO Investment and UMC Capital 2020 June Expansion into US and Europe 2021 March Appier completes its listing on Tokyo Stock Exchange, Mothers (currently known as “Growth”) section May Appier acquires BotBonnie, omni-channel conversational marketing platform 2022 October Appier acquires US-based company Woopra to create the next-gen, AI-powered Customer Data Platform with superior analytics and intuitive data visualization December Appier completes its listing on Tokyo Stock Exchange, Prime section December Appier launches AIRIS, the next-gen AI-powered CDP to shorten the time spent from data to insight and insight to action 2023 April Appier was awarded “Best Talent Acquisition Team” in 2022 by LinkedIn Taiwan August Appier was awarded “Outstanding Company” in Japan's software & services sector by Asiamoney November Appier AI Personalization Cloud AIQUA was awarded the ""Advanced Technology Award"" in the AI category at the Japan ASPIC Cloud Awards 2024 March Appier ranked as the top ROI-driving ad partner by Singular July Appier receives the ""Emerging Companies Growing Abroad"" IR Award from Nihon Securities Journal October Appier becomes an official partner of Google’s Privacy Sandbox initiative December Appier won Best App Marketing Platform at the 2024 App Growth Awards in APS Berlin 2025 March Appier acquires Paris-based AdCreative.ai as a strategic step toward advancing Generative AI innovation in advertising and marketing April Ranked as the top ROI-driving ad partner by Singular for the second consecutive year. May Received “AA” rating from MSCI ESG Research in recognition of Appier’s strong governance and proactive integration of sustainability and ESG principles into our operations and disclosures. 2026 March Appier selected as a constituent of JPX Startup Acceleration 100 Index, comprising Japan’s top high-growth startups Leadership Team Chih-Han Yu Chief Executive Officer & Co-founder | Executive Leadership Wan-Ling Lee Chief Operating Officer & Co-founder | Executive Leadership Ming-Yu Chen Chief Technology Officer | Executive Leadership Chia-Yung Su Chief Information Officer & Co-founder | Executive Leadership Che-Hsu Chang Chief Strategy Officer | Executive Leadership View All Start a career, not a job We believe in giving everyone the opportunity to shape their own path along with the tools to grow and advance. We collaborate, we motivate, we celebrate. And we build an environment whe