4,4216,4216.T,旭有機材,3,ok,EQUITY,Asahi Yukizai Corporation,Industrials,Building Products & Equipment,https://www.asahi-yukizai.co.jp,"Asahi Yukizai Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the pipe and fittings system, resin, and water treatment and resource development businesses in Japan, the United States, and internationally. It offers manual and automatic valves, as well as plastic pipes and fittings under the ASAHIAV brand; plastic valves under the Dymatrix brand; flow control systems under the Falconics brand; mixers under the Mixworx brand; and engineering services, including tank design and manufacturing, resin processed product manufacturing, structural and piping stress analysis, and supervisor dispatch, as well as piping design and installation, prefabrication, and checks. The company also provides phenolic resins for casting processes, industrial fields, and photoresists; resin coated sands for casting processes; and urethane insulating materials for housing, construction, and civil engineering sectors. In addition, it is involved in the geological survey consulting, well drilling, and geothermal and hot spring development; design and construction of drinking, industrial, gray, and recycled water, as well as household wastewater; industrial water and wastewater treatment; and maintenance and management services. The company was formerly known as Asahi Organic Chemicals Industry Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Asahi Yukizai Corporation in April 2016. Asahi Yukizai Corporation was incorporated in 1945 and is headquartered in Taito, Japan.",111388483584,JPY,,ok,https://www.asahi-yukizai.co.jp,旭有機材株式会社 | 旭有機材 ホーム ニュース 企業情報 企業情報 TOP トップメッセージ 旭有機材の事業 管材システム事業 樹脂事業 水処理・資源開発事業 会社概要 企業理念 役員紹介 国内・海外事業拠点 グループ会社一覧 旭有機材の歴史 旭有機材の歴史 沿革 会社案内 採用情報 製品・ソリューション 製品・ソリューション TOP 管材システム事業 管材システム事業 TOP 製品情報 カタログ 図面・取扱説明書 価格表 耐薬品表 ニュース 営業拠点 バルブサイジングソフト 安全データシート（SDS） 配管診断 輸出貿易管理・該非判定書類自動発行サービス お困りごと相談室 安全にご使用いただくために 製品保証について 樹脂事業 樹脂事業 TOP 製品カタログ お客様の声 導入事例 登録商標のご紹介