4,4229,4229.T,群栄化,3,ok,EQUITY,"Gun Ei Chemical Industry Co., Ltd.",Basic Materials,Specialty Chemicals,https://www.gunei-chemical.co.jp,"Gun Ei Chemical Industry Co., Ltd., together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and sells synthetic resins and fibers in Japan and internationally. It operates through three segments: Chemicals Business, Food Business, Real Estate Utilization Business. The company offers Resitop for photoresists, epoxy curing agent, maleimide curing agent, liquid type Resitop, and high purity bisphenol F; casting iron and aluminum casts; automobiles and construction machines; molding materials, papermaking, coated abrasive, resinoid grinding stone, carbon insulating materials, spherical carbon, air filter, oil filter, scoring pad, high-performance fiber, carbon fiber, and Kynol activated carbon fiber products; and heat insulating material Resitop for glass wool/rock wool. In addition, the company provides food, such as starches and sugars; and business outsourcing and staffing services. Further, it is involved in the leasing of real estate. Further, the company offers Milex, a phenolic resin for brake pads that improves braking through a chemical reaction based on a unique technology. Gun Ei Chemical Industry Co., Ltd. was founded in 1946 and is headquartered in Takasaki, Japan.",27837806592,JPY,,home_unavailable,https://www.gunei-chemical.co.jp,
4,4231,4231.T,4231.T,3,ok,EQUITY,Tigers Polymer Corporation,Basic Materials,Specialty Chemicals,https://www.tiger-poly.com,"Tigers Polymer Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and sells rubber hoses, sheets, and molded products in Japan, Southeast Asia, the Americas, and China. It offers home appliance hoses for vacuum cleaners, washing machines, air conditioners, and hot water supply and room heating equipment; industrial hoses, suction/ delivery hoses, duct hoses, and coupling/cuff. The company also provides natural, synthetic, special, and polyurethane rubber sheets; and extrusion products such as silicone, MediL tube, and fluoro rubber stopper. In addition, it offers rubber molded products such as rubber injection, compression, transfer, mandrel, and liquid injection molding; and plastic molded products includes injection, direct and suction blow, continuous blow, and joint section parting lineless molding, as well as hot plate, vibration, and ultrasonic welding; and electrical facility materials. It serves automotive, home appliance, civil engineering and construction, air conditioning, industrial material and machine material industries. The company was formerly known as Tigers Rubber Inc. and changed its name to Tigers Polymer Corporation in June 1973. Tigers Polymer Corporation was founded in 1938 and is headquartered in Osaka, Japan.",20367458304,JPY,,ok,https://www.tiger-poly.com,"Hose Plastic Rubber | TIGERS POLYMER CORPORATION Main Products Main Products Top Hoses Sheets Extrusion Products Molded Products Electrical Facility Materials Automotive Home Appliances Civil Engineering and Construction Air conditioning Industrial Materials/Industrial Machine Materials Corporate Profile Corporate Profile Top President's Message Management Philosophy Corporate Profile History Our locations Overseas Subsidiaries Group Companies Environmental Policy Contact Us / Brochures Privacy Policy Site Map JP EN JP EN Main Products Corporate Profile Envir