4,4345,4345.T,4345.T,5,ok,EQUITY,"CTS Co., Ltd.",Industrials,Rental & Leasing Services,https://www.cts-h.co.jp,"CTS Co., Ltd. primarily engages in the provision of ICT construction services for the construction industry in Japan. The company also offers cloud storage services; mobaden, a mobile fixed IP phone service for on-site offices; outdoor network construction; cloud video and recording services, as well as CTS network camera rental services; remote work support services through GENBA Connect, a communication tool based on a web conference system, as well as GENBA Connect SP, a remote work support system that enables real-time two-way communication with a cloud continuous recording type wearable camera and a viewer for viewing; printing services; and sensor information solutions. In addition, it offers 3D measurement, one-man survey, 3D design data, ICT construction, construction management, electronic delivery, and other surveying and measuring equipment, such as lasers; and inspects and repair surveying instruments. Further, the company provides office furniture, home appliances, air conditioners, and heating equipment; and rents and sells office desks, meeting tables, chairs, bookshelves, etc., as well as provides sterilization cleaning services. Additionally, it engages in the road sign construction activity; installation of guard fences; and designing and construction of emergency shelters, solar lighting, and health playground equipment. CTS Co., Ltd. was founded in 1972 and is headquartered in Ueda, Japan.",34204463104,JPY,,ok,https://www.cts-h.co.jp,株式会社シーティーエス｜建設業・官公庁向けICTソリューション・測量機器レンタル 株式会社シーティーエス Beyond Construction. 建設の枠を超え、 未来の現場を創造する。 プログラム ダウンロード 遠隔サポート シーティーエスについて About Us 建設DXを推進する建設ICTの専門企業です。 企業のビジネス変革と成長をご一緒に目指します。 Message 社長挨拶 Company 会社概要 会社情報トップ 事業案内 Business 建設現場の生産性向上から社会インフラの安全な維持管理まで、 建設現場のあらゆる課題解決に貢献します。 DDS事業 デジタルデータサービス事業 クラウドを中心としたICT・IoTサービスで建設現場の働き方改革を推進し人手不足を解消する、現場業務支援（サイトアシスト）による新しい仕事のやり方・進め方を統合的にご提案致します。 建設業向け サイトアシスト サービ