4,4443,4443.T,Ｓａｎｓａｎ,6,ok,EQUITY,"Sansan, Inc.",Technology,Software - Application,https://www.corp-sansan.com,"Sansan, Inc. engages in the planning, development, and selling of cloud-based solutions in Japan. The company offers Sansan, a cloud-based solution that manages business cards and contacts, and company information, as well as sales history, enabling the sharing of this data companywide to increase net sales while reducing costs; Bill One, a cloud-based solution to receive and digitizes all invoices; Contract One, a digitally transforming solution; AskOne, a multichannel form that collects customer feedback from all touchpoints and supports continuous improvements in customer experience; and Eight, a business card app for contacts and career movements. It also provides logmi Biz, Finance, and Tech, an event transcription service that logs complete transcriptions of press conferences, events, and interviews and delivers information to the audience. Sansan, Inc. was incorporated in 2007 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan.",279227072512,JPY,,ok,https://www.corp-sansan.com | https://www.corp-sansan.com/service | https://www.corp-sansan.com/company,"Sansan, Inc. News Service Technology Company Company Top Our Profile Our Philosophy Leaders Access Investor Relations Investor Relations Top IR News Management Information Financial Information IR Materials Stock Information For New Investors IR Calendar IR Site Map IR Policy External Evaluations FAQ Disclaimer Sustainability Sustainability Top Sustainability News CEO Commitment Sustainability Management Environment Society Governance ESG Data Comparison Table NEXT – CSV Initiatives Careers Japanese Watch video Sansan The sales AX solution that centralizes data such as business cards and contacts, online activity, and meeting history to build a unique database shareable company-wide. AI can then be leveraged to maximize that data for increasing revenue and reducing costs. Bill One The accounting AX solution that applies AI and other technologies to redefine the unnecessary in business workflows involving documents such as invoices and receipts, transforming how your company works. Contract One The contract management AX solution that centralizes all contracts and builds a contract database that’s easily actionable for people and AI. It enables control of contract terms company-wide to protect corporate profits. Eight Open the Eight app to easily share your Virtual Card with anyone and automatically stay updated on your contacts' career moves. Sansan Data Intelligence The data quality management solution that keeps data on business partners current and accurate, promotes data utilization, and supports corporate AI transformation. Sansan technology powers AX (AI transformation) News Service Technology Company Our Profile Our Philosophy Leaders Access Investor Relations IR News Management Information Financial Information IR Materials Stock Information For New Investors IR Calendar IR Site Map IR Policy External Evaluations FAQ Disclaimer Sustainability Sustainability News CEO Commitment Sustainability Management Environment Society Governance ESG Data Comparison Table NEXT – CSV Initiatives Careers Compliance Basic Policy Commitment to Personal Information Protection Information Security Policy Basic Policy Regarding Prevention of Bribery and Corruption Basic Policy Regarding Antisocial Forces Basic Policy on Human Rights Social Media Policy Website Terms of Use Contact Sitemap © Sansan, Inc. Products/Services | Sansan, Inc. News Service Technology Company Company Top Our Profile Our Philosophy Leaders Access Investor Relations Investor Relations Top IR News Management Information Financial Information IR Materials Stock Information For New Investors IR Calendar IR Site Map IR Policy External Evaluations FAQ Disclaimer Sustainability Sustainability Top Sustainability News CEO Commitment Sustainability Management Environment Society Governance ESG Data Comparison Table NEXT – CSV Initiatives Careers Japanese The sales AX solution The accounting AX solution The contract management AX solution The data quality management solution Business card app TOP Products/Services Cloud-based solutions that promote AI transformation and reshape how we work We provide cloud-based solutions related to business cards and contacts, invoices, and contracts. Our solutions integrate and improve the quality of data distributed organization-wide. They promote AI transformation and reshape how people work, building databases that not only boost productivity but also maximize how companies use AI. The sales AX solution The contact database that maximizes your business Sansan is the sales AX solution that centralizes data such as business cards and contacts, online activity, and meeting history to build a unique database shareable company-wide. AI can then be leveraged to maximize that data for increasing revenue and reducing costs. *Contents may differ from services offered outside Japan. Learn more (in Japanese) Global (English) TV Commercial Customer Story The accounting AX solution Redefine the unnecessary. Transform how your company works. Bill One is the accounting AX solution that applies AI and other technologies to redefine the unnecessary in business workflows involving documents such as invoices and receipts, transforming how your company works. *Contents may differ from services offered outside Japan. Learn more (in Japanese) Global (English) TV Commercial The contract management AX solution Control your profits with the contract database Contract One is the contract management AX solution that centralizes all contracts and builds a contract database that’s easily actionable for people and AI. It enables control of contract terms company-wide to protect corporate profits. Learn more (in Japanese) TV Commercial The data quality management solution Sansan Data Intelligence is the data quality management solution that keeps data on business partners current and accurate, promotes data utilization, and supports corporate AI transformation. Learn more (in Japanese) Business card app Eight is an app that lets you easily share your Virtual Card with anyone and automatically stay updated on your contacts’ career moves. Learn more (in Japanese) Global (English) Sansan technology powers AX (AI transformation) Generative AI only delivers real value in business when accurate business data is in place. Sansan has the proprietary technology to accurately digitize analog information such as business cards and contacts, invoices, and contracts. Learn more News Service Technology Company Our Profile Our Philosophy Leaders Access Investor Relations IR News Management Information Financial Information IR Materials Stock Information For New Investors IR Calendar IR Site Map IR Policy External Evaluations FAQ Disclaimer Sustainability Sustainability News CEO Commitment Sustainability Management Environment Society Governance ESG Data Comparison Table NEXT – CSV Initiatives Careers Compliance Basic Policy Commitment to Personal Information Protection Information Security Policy Basic Policy Regarding Prevention of Bribery and Corruption Basic Policy Regarding Antisocial Forces Basic Policy on Human Rights Social Media Policy Website Terms of Use Contact Sitemap © Sansan, Inc. Company | Sansan, Inc. News Service Technology Company Company Top Our Profile Our Philosophy Leaders Access Investor Relations Investor Relations Top IR News Management Information Financial Information IR Materials Stock Information For New Investors IR Calendar IR Site Map IR Policy External Evaluations FAQ Disclaimer Sustainability Sustainability Top Sustainability News CEO Commitment Sustainability Management Environment Society Governance ESG Data Comparison Table NEXT – CSV Initiatives Careers Japanese Company Information TOP Company Greeting Connect Smarter Someone meets someone. That’s how everything starts. A single encounter can change everything. That’s